WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 44

01:38.940 --> 01:41.050
Auntie, what else do you tell him?

01:41.730 --> 01:43.070
Nothing else.

01:43.090 --> 01:44.310
I just warned him

01:44.330 --> 01:45.810
when he left.

01:46.130 --> 01:47.410
About what?

01:59.820 --> 02:02.880
After thinking about it,

02:03.090 --> 02:05.240
I'd better warn you about one thing.

02:06.180 --> 02:08.320
Did I miss anything?

02:09.140 --> 02:12.290
Since you told the Empress Dowager

02:12.290 --> 02:13.290
that you have feelings for me.

02:13.290 --> 02:14.270
You can't let others

02:14.290 --> 02:16.960
see through your lie.

02:16.980 --> 02:18.280
Pardon?

02:19.620 --> 02:20.780
I said you can't let others

02:20.780 --> 02:22.270
see through your lie.

02:22.290 --> 02:23.190
Don't worry.

02:23.210 --> 02:23.700
During this period,

02:23.700 --> 02:25.120
I'll visit you often.

02:26.780 --> 02:27.830
It's getting cold.

02:27.850 --> 02:29.140
Take showers with ice water more often.

02:29.140 --> 02:30.190
Why?

02:30.210 --> 02:33.330
To keep your mind clear and suppress your nature.

02:34.340 --> 02:35.520
What are you talking about?

02:35.540 --> 02:37.280
When you see me often,

02:37.420 --> 02:39.470
do remember to control yourself.

02:39.490 --> 02:40.880
Keep alert all the time.

02:40.900 --> 02:43.480
Control your feelings. Don't take it seriously.

02:48.930 --> 02:50.350
I'm just afraid

02:50.370 --> 02:52.250
you might hurt yourself.

03:11.980 --> 03:13.840
You said that?

03:14.650 --> 03:16.200
What's wrong?

03:19.290 --> 03:22.090
Auntie, you're really...

03:22.620 --> 03:23.710
Really what?

03:23.730 --> 03:25.040
Nothing.

03:25.060 --> 03:26.400
I suddenly feel Fan Xian and you

03:26.420 --> 03:29.200
are made for each other.

03:34.060 --> 03:36.040
His Majesty must be confused.

03:36.850 --> 03:37.420
Your Excellency,

03:37.420 --> 03:38.090
the water is cold.

03:38.090 --> 03:40.000
Let me add some warm water for you.

03:40.730 --> 03:42.370
Why do I have to suppress my nature?

03:42.370 --> 03:44.120
Why would I hurt myself?

03:44.140 --> 03:45.540
She seems to keep a low profile usually,

03:45.540 --> 03:47.680
but she's so narcissistic actually!

03:47.700 --> 03:48.780
Do I have to marry her

03:48.780 --> 03:50.430
by simply looking at her?

03:50.450 --> 03:52.040
How ridiculous!

03:52.060 --> 03:54.400
Your Excellency, you're so angry.

03:54.420 --> 03:55.570
Do you feel a bit regretful?

03:55.570 --> 03:56.800
Bullshit!

03:56.820 --> 03:57.910
Regret for what?

03:57.930 --> 04:00.370
I'm just angry! I'm so mad!

04:00.570 --> 04:01.990
It feels like...

04:02.010 --> 04:03.200
like...

04:03.620 --> 04:05.470
Do you understand?

04:05.490 --> 04:06.430
Yes.

04:06.450 --> 04:07.630
Get insulted by someone,

04:07.650 --> 04:09.290
who runs away in time,

04:09.290 --> 04:09.730
right?

04:09.730 --> 04:10.920
Yes!

04:12.140 --> 04:13.320
No!

04:13.340 --> 04:15.190
It doesn't sound right!

04:15.210 --> 04:16.090
Your Excellency, please calm down.

04:16.090 --> 04:17.170
If you

04:17.170 --> 04:18.520
feel angry,

04:18.540 --> 04:20.560
you can use your charm

04:20.580 --> 04:22.140
to bewitch her

04:22.140 --> 04:23.090
and make her lose her mind.

04:23.090 --> 04:24.960
Later, just ignore her.

04:24.980 --> 04:25.770
By then, you can

04:25.770 --> 04:26.840
vent your anger.

04:26.860 --> 04:27.490
Fine.

04:27.490 --> 04:28.740
When we go back to the capital city,

04:28.740 --> 04:29.540
repeat what you just said

04:29.540 --> 04:31.020
to Wan'er.

04:31.020 --> 04:31.540
No! No! No!

04:31.540 --> 04:32.330
Your Excellency! Your Excellency!

04:32.330 --> 04:33.460
Your Excellency, please forgive me.

04:33.460 --> 04:35.000
I'll never say that again.

04:35.020 --> 04:36.190
Are you here

04:36.210 --> 04:37.810
to say that?

04:38.420 --> 04:40.090
Of course not.

04:40.300 --> 04:41.210
Have you heard

04:41.210 --> 04:42.760
what I've done clearly?

04:43.090 --> 04:44.470
Conspiring with the imperial family

04:44.490 --> 04:46.440
of Beiqi on smuggling in private.

04:46.460 --> 04:48.720
I'll report that when we return to the capital city.

04:48.740 --> 04:49.740
If I really want to smuggle goods,

04:49.740 --> 04:51.280
will I tell you about it?

04:51.300 --> 04:53.630
Your Excellency, you want to use the smuggling as an excuse...

04:53.650 --> 04:54.490
To associate with

04:54.490 --> 04:56.470
the imperial family of Beiqi openly

04:56.490 --> 04:57.260
From now on,

04:57.260 --> 04:58.050
with money clearing the way,

04:58.050 --> 04:59.910
it'll be way easier to pry into information.

04:59.930 --> 05:01.520
Shen Zhong won't allow it.

05:01.540 --> 05:02.330
So we have to

05:02.330 --> 05:03.840
crush him completely.

05:03.860 --> 05:05.240
I need your help for that.

05:05.260 --> 05:06.680
I'm not recovered yet.

05:06.700 --> 05:07.800
How can I help you?

05:07.820 --> 05:09.020
Hand the intelligence network of the Investigator's Office

05:09.020 --> 05:10.720
in Shangjing Town over to me.

05:17.460 --> 05:18.930
It's an order from Chen Pingping.

05:18.930 --> 05:20.240
After going back,

05:20.260 --> 05:21.330
I'll ask the Head in person.

05:21.330 --> 05:22.740
That's too late!

05:22.740 --> 05:23.460
Our intelligence network is in the dark.

05:23.460 --> 05:24.630
It's the safest.

05:24.650 --> 05:25.460
How can that be late?

05:25.460 --> 05:27.090
We have to destroy Shen Zhong now.

05:27.090 --> 05:28.720
We need a push.

05:33.770 --> 05:36.000
Are you still suspicious of me?

05:36.020 --> 05:38.190
Considering your temperament, I'm just worried.

05:38.210 --> 05:39.020
It's all for

05:39.020 --> 05:40.020
getting the smuggler's name

05:40.020 --> 05:41.970
out of Shen Zhong.

05:42.210 --> 05:42.860
No hurry.

05:42.860 --> 05:45.040
Aren't you eager to find out the truth?

05:45.490 --> 05:46.750
I've thought about it.

05:46.770 --> 05:47.910
After going back to the capital city,

05:47.930 --> 05:49.850
I'll tell the Head the whole thing.

05:49.930 --> 05:51.920
He surely can find the chief culprit.

05:52.980 --> 05:54.740
Then Chen Pingping will get the credit

05:54.740 --> 05:56.150
instead of me.

05:56.170 --> 05:57.690
Do you want to take the credit?

05:58.930 --> 06:01.440
I'm just tired of being a chess piece.

06:02.140 --> 06:03.090
You don't trust the Head?!

06:03.090 --> 06:04.970
Now I trust no one.

06:06.330 --> 06:07.260
Then it's more unlikely for me

06:07.260 --> 06:09.000
to give you what the Investigator's Office has achieved

06:09.020 --> 06:10.850
after years of painstaking labor.

06:15.490 --> 06:16.540
The man behind the smuggler

06:16.540 --> 06:18.320
must be paramount and powerful.

06:18.890 --> 06:20.640
If we investigate into the case when we're back,

06:20.930 --> 06:22.520
any leak of information

06:22.540 --> 06:24.200
is bound to cause turbulence.

06:31.650 --> 06:34.000
If you really put Nanqing first,

06:34.020 --> 06:36.040
you should help me figure out the truth.

06:38.330 --> 06:38.930
I also don't know

06:38.930 --> 06:40.090
how many secret agents of

06:40.090 --> 06:41.630
the Investigator's Office

06:41.650 --> 06:42.630
are hiding in Beiqi?

06:42.650 --> 06:43.680
Why?

06:43.700 --> 06:45.190
It's not long since I was transferred to Shangjing after all.

06:45.210 --> 06:47.040
Then how do you use the intelligence network?

06:48.460 --> 06:50.240
Through one man.

06:50.260 --> 06:51.310
I dispatch secret agents in Shangjing

06:51.330 --> 06:52.840
through him.

06:52.860 --> 06:54.690
Tell me who he is.

07:05.260 --> 07:06.720
It's all for Nanqing.

07:23.080 --> 07:26.310
=Oil shop=

07:30.050 --> 07:31.050
Miss, don't worry.

07:31.050 --> 07:32.810
I'll deliver it to your home later.

07:33.420 --> 07:35.250
Boss, I want to buy oil.

07:36.140 --> 07:37.800
Sir, which oil do you want?

07:37.820 --> 07:38.840
Half jin of palm oil.

07:38.860 --> 07:40.000
OK.

07:40.020 --> 07:40.770
Do you have any pot?

07:40.770 --> 07:42.720
Yes, three coins for one pot.

07:42.740 --> 07:44.290
Do you have sesame oil?

07:49.540 --> 07:50.960
The sesame oil is too expensive.

07:50.980 --> 07:52.310
Unless it's time for worshipping the Heaven,

07:52.330 --> 07:53.440
no one buys it normally.

07:53.460 --> 07:56.720
Besides worshipping the Heaven,
it can also be used to mourn people.

07:58.610 --> 07:59.760
Fine.

07:59.930 --> 08:01.240
How much do you want?

08:01.260 --> 08:03.560
We can order it for you.

08:03.580 --> 08:06.440
Seven jin six taels nine qians four haos.

08:13.420 --> 08:14.020
Boss,

08:14.020 --> 08:14.860
why do you close

08:14.860 --> 08:15.610
so early today?

08:15.610 --> 08:17.020
Sorry, please come back tomorrow.

08:17.020 --> 08:18.130
But I...

08:25.580 --> 08:26.800
Finally, you're here.

08:26.820 --> 08:28.120
After the Chief was caught,

08:28.140 --> 08:30.150
no one has been sent by the imperial court to take over.

08:30.170 --> 08:31.310
I thought

08:31.330 --> 08:33.080
they want us to stay quiet.

08:33.100 --> 08:34.960
Yan Bingyun was rescued.

08:36.850 --> 08:38.130
That's good.

08:38.410 --> 08:39.270
He told me that

08:39.290 --> 08:40.490
you're in charge of dispatching

08:40.490 --> 08:42.280
the secret agents in Shangjing Town.

08:43.220 --> 08:45.250
Is there a secret order for us?

08:45.700 --> 08:46.900
I've persuaded Shangshan Hu

08:46.900 --> 08:48.520
to serve the Empress Dowager of Beiqi.

08:49.050 --> 08:50.720
Now, what you should do is

08:50.850 --> 08:51.930
to spread my words with Shen Zhong

08:51.930 --> 08:53.510
in the imperial palace today

08:53.530 --> 08:54.800
on the street

08:54.820 --> 08:56.720
as chitchat.

08:57.580 --> 08:58.440
It's a piece of cake.

08:58.460 --> 09:01.650
I'll inform our agents in a moment.

09:01.730 --> 09:03.480
He will work with you.

09:05.820 --> 09:07.130
But Your Excellency,

09:07.410 --> 09:09.400
identities of secret agents in Shangjing

09:09.580 --> 09:11.370
are top secrets.

09:12.820 --> 09:14.520
How long have you stayed in Shangjing Town?

09:15.170 --> 09:15.850
Over ten years.

09:15.850 --> 09:16.880
Do you miss home?

09:16.900 --> 09:17.830
Of course I do.

09:17.850 --> 09:19.390
When this is over,

09:19.410 --> 09:20.810
you can go home.

09:21.820 --> 09:23.080
He will replace you to

09:23.100 --> 09:25.160
manage the intelligence network of Shangjing Town.

09:30.660 --> 09:31.850
I didn't receive such an order.

09:31.850 --> 09:33.600
I just made the decision.

09:36.700 --> 09:37.960
Your Excellency,

09:38.660 --> 09:40.480
what's your position

09:40.970 --> 09:42.650
in the Investigator's Office?

09:46.490 --> 09:48.200
Director-General!

09:48.220 --> 09:49.770
Do you have any other question?

09:50.970 --> 09:51.930
It's a big deal.

09:51.930 --> 09:53.000
It's my decision.

09:53.020 --> 09:54.510
I'll take

09:54.530 --> 09:55.840
any consequence.

09:57.140 --> 09:57.820
If Yan Bingyun

09:57.820 --> 09:59.470
doesn't agree with the appointment,

09:59.490 --> 10:01.200
he wouldn't send me to you.

10:01.220 --> 10:02.350
I know,

10:02.370 --> 10:03.020
but...

10:03.020 --> 10:04.690
But after staying in Shangjing for ten years,

10:04.900 --> 10:06.890
you must have made some new friends.

10:07.700 --> 10:09.010
Yes.

10:09.370 --> 10:11.120
It's also for maintaining my current identity.

10:11.140 --> 10:12.890
Now that you're reluctant to take the order,

10:13.340 --> 10:15.770
is it because you're unwilling to leave Shangjing

10:16.490 --> 10:18.710
and part with your Beiqi friends?

10:18.730 --> 10:20.210
Absolutely not!

10:20.290 --> 10:23.810
I'll take the order.

10:25.290 --> 10:28.560
But I wonder

10:28.580 --> 10:29.960
which division he is from

10:30.020 --> 10:31.710
and which Director he is working for.

10:31.730 --> 10:33.520
He's not from the Investigator's Office.

10:34.020 --> 10:35.280
What?

10:35.610 --> 10:37.120
Let me introduce.

10:37.140 --> 10:39.240
This is the son of Guo Youzhi, the Minister of Board of Rites.

10:39.260 --> 10:40.770
You can call him Guo Baokun.

10:51.490 --> 10:52.760
But Your Excellency,

10:52.780 --> 10:54.130
the secret agents of Shangjing

10:54.220 --> 10:56.030
are managed by the Investigators Office all along.

10:56.050 --> 10:57.920
He's my subordinate.

11:00.340 --> 11:01.340
If you have a problem with me,

11:01.340 --> 11:02.340
you can submit a memorial

11:02.340 --> 11:03.910
to impeach me when you're back to the capital city.

11:03.930 --> 11:06.810
But now, just do what you're told.

11:07.820 --> 11:09.280
I dare not.

11:10.820 --> 11:12.710
Fine. You may leave.

11:12.730 --> 11:14.370
I need a word with him.

11:18.100 --> 11:20.210
I'll get things ready in the backyard.

11:20.900 --> 11:21.910
In a little while,

11:21.930 --> 11:23.450
I'll introduce him to

11:23.580 --> 11:27.480
all the secret agents in Shangjing.

11:34.970 --> 11:36.330
Think it over.

11:36.610 --> 11:37.410
From now on,

11:37.410 --> 11:39.880
you'll stay in an enemy capital alone

11:39.900 --> 11:41.400
and face great danger.

11:43.970 --> 11:46.010
You promised to save my dad.

11:46.370 --> 11:47.920
I will.

11:48.660 --> 11:50.210
Why me?

11:50.730 --> 11:53.080
The intelligence network of Shangjing
Town is of great importance,

11:53.140 --> 11:54.710
the one in charge must be my man.

11:54.730 --> 11:56.650
I'm not your subordinate.

11:56.700 --> 11:58.130
Except me,

11:58.260 --> 12:00.160
who else will save your dad?

12:01.530 --> 12:03.890
Who else can save your dad?

12:05.460 --> 12:07.250
I'm your only option.

12:11.700 --> 12:13.720
Dare you lie to me,

12:14.220 --> 12:16.280
I'll kill your with my own hands.

12:16.370 --> 12:17.920
No,

12:17.970 --> 12:20.650
you must let me kill you.

12:20.850 --> 12:22.080
Rest assured.

12:39.850 --> 12:41.160
Moreover,

12:41.370 --> 12:43.010
Shen Zhong knows me.

12:43.410 --> 12:45.370
He'll be a hidden danger.

12:45.970 --> 12:47.240
Don't worry.

12:47.260 --> 12:48.220
You're a shield

12:48.220 --> 12:50.480
especially for Shen Zhong.

12:50.700 --> 12:51.410
You only need to run the business

12:51.410 --> 12:52.850
and give bribes.

12:52.850 --> 12:54.100
Matters concerning the secret agents

12:54.100 --> 12:55.770
will be managed by others.

12:59.490 --> 13:00.690
Who?

13:03.610 --> 13:05.880
What if someone comes to examine the shop?

13:05.900 --> 13:06.830
The smuggling

13:06.850 --> 13:09.520
is a deal with the Beiqi's upper class.

13:09.580 --> 13:10.850
Once the profit chain spreads out,

13:10.850 --> 13:12.240
many people will benefit.

13:12.260 --> 13:13.350
No matter what happens,

13:13.370 --> 13:15.890
they'll handle it for you.

13:19.700 --> 13:21.450
Unbelievable!

13:23.170 --> 13:24.830
It's dangerous and inefficient

13:24.850 --> 13:25.950
to risk your life inquiring about information

13:25.970 --> 13:27.640
and hide yourself.

13:27.660 --> 13:29.350
It's time to change your mind.

13:29.370 --> 13:31.440
From now on, with money clearing the way,

13:31.460 --> 13:33.710
we can have our enemy protect us.

13:33.730 --> 13:35.370
But Shen Zhong is against this.

13:35.370 --> 13:37.320
Shen Zhong won't be a problem.

13:37.340 --> 13:39.600
It's an irresistible trend.

13:39.660 --> 13:41.240
One man alone can't stop it.

13:41.260 --> 13:42.570
That makes sense.

13:49.780 --> 13:52.160
Don't smirk.

13:57.930 --> 13:58.820
Have you heard?

13:58.820 --> 13:59.700
Someone from Nanqing

13:59.700 --> 14:01.770
wants to cooperate with us.

14:01.850 --> 14:03.350
By the time the trade route opens,

14:03.370 --> 14:05.350
it will bring a large sum of money.

14:05.370 --> 14:06.150
I heard that

14:06.170 --> 14:07.710
it will be handled by the Embroidered Uniform Guards.

14:07.730 --> 14:08.900
If it succeeds,

14:08.900 --> 14:10.390
our Division will benefit.

14:10.410 --> 14:11.640
I'm afraid it won't be easy.

14:11.660 --> 14:12.390
A couple of days ago,

14:12.410 --> 14:14.470
Commander Shen said on the Hall that

14:14.490 --> 14:16.270
he wouldn't help to make it happen.

14:16.290 --> 14:17.640
Really?

14:17.660 --> 14:19.530
Haven't you heard about their talks on the Hall?

14:19.530 --> 14:20.720
Tell us about it.

14:20.930 --> 14:22.530
A couple of days ago, Commander Shen said

14:22.530 --> 14:24.480
in front of Her Majesty that...

14:31.460 --> 14:32.270
Your Excellency,

14:32.290 --> 14:33.100
your words with Fan Xian

14:33.100 --> 14:35.150
in front of Her Majesty

14:35.170 --> 14:37.280
are spreading everywhere.

14:37.530 --> 14:39.470
Fan Xian has made a nice move.

14:39.490 --> 14:41.040
However, he forgot that the capital is

14:41.370 --> 14:43.720
controlled by Embroidered Uniform Guards.

14:48.930 --> 14:50.270
Pass on my order to each battalion commanders.

14:50.290 --> 14:51.880
Spare no efforts in blocking the rumor

14:51.900 --> 14:53.400
and check strictly.

14:55.850 --> 14:57.220
Are these vegetables picked today?

14:57.220 --> 14:57.780
Yes.

14:57.780 --> 14:59.480
They're fresh. Just picked.

15:01.020 --> 15:02.000
Have a look!

15:02.020 --> 15:03.200
Fresh pork.

15:03.220 --> 15:04.480
Ribs also.

15:06.410 --> 15:08.400
Lady, do you want anything?

15:08.730 --> 15:10.240
It looks good.

15:10.260 --> 15:11.020
Just picked.

15:11.020 --> 15:12.080
Give me two.

15:12.100 --> 15:13.490
Shouldn't all Saintesses love

15:13.490 --> 15:14.910
ancient calligraphy and paintings

15:14.930 --> 15:16.470
or magic weapons?

15:16.490 --> 15:18.130
But I prefer eating.

15:18.930 --> 15:19.820
Please trim them for me.

15:19.820 --> 15:20.700
Remove the leaves outside.

15:20.700 --> 15:21.530
OK! OK!

15:21.530 --> 15:23.570
The leaves outside are not fresh.

15:24.220 --> 15:26.520
Don't put them inside.

15:29.220 --> 15:31.010
These are all fresh.

15:34.410 --> 15:36.130
Should you pay attention?

15:36.700 --> 15:37.680
To what?

15:37.700 --> 15:38.820
You're a Saintess after all.

15:38.820 --> 15:40.960
The basket doesn't go with your temperament.

15:41.410 --> 15:43.080
I'm not in the imperial palace.

15:43.100 --> 15:44.270
You should pay attention to

15:44.290 --> 15:45.340
your temperament all the time.

15:45.340 --> 15:46.340
It's not only for pretending

15:46.340 --> 15:47.570
in the imperial Palace.

15:48.050 --> 15:49.400
You've got a point.

15:51.970 --> 15:53.210
Carry it for me.

15:58.490 --> 15:59.350
I have a question for you.

15:59.370 --> 16:00.480
Go ahead.

16:00.970 --> 16:02.760
Are you responsible for the rumor

16:02.780 --> 16:03.800
in the capital recently?

16:03.820 --> 16:05.040
Yes.

16:06.050 --> 16:07.600
Then do you know

16:07.660 --> 16:09.200
Shen Zhong has ordered Embroidered Uniform Guards

16:09.220 --> 16:10.560
to block the information?

16:10.580 --> 16:11.920
It won't work.

16:13.460 --> 16:15.400
The power of Embroidered Uniform Guards

16:15.460 --> 16:17.200
is beyond your imagination.

16:17.220 --> 16:19.240
I know, but it still won't work.

16:19.260 --> 16:21.210
How about making a bet?

16:21.850 --> 16:23.650
So you're really confident.

16:40.100 --> 16:42.510
Your Excellency, do you want to see me?

16:42.530 --> 16:44.150
Haven't I given the order?

16:44.170 --> 16:45.140
How come the rumor

16:45.140 --> 16:47.080
is still rampant these days.

16:48.610 --> 16:49.830
Your Excellency,

16:49.850 --> 16:51.120
all the battalion commanders said

16:51.140 --> 16:52.770
they had acted according to your order,

16:52.820 --> 16:54.030
but it doesn't work.

16:54.050 --> 16:56.000
I've urged them repeatedly,

16:56.020 --> 16:57.240
but they said

16:57.260 --> 16:58.650
they had tried their best.

16:59.140 --> 17:00.480
Well...

17:19.290 --> 17:20.500
Why are you so sure

17:20.500 --> 17:22.630
the Embroidered Uniform Guards won't take it seriously?

17:22.650 --> 17:24.440
Because they're human.

17:24.890 --> 17:26.110
So what?

17:26.130 --> 17:28.110
Humans are selfish.

17:28.130 --> 17:30.290
If the smuggling falls into place,

17:30.380 --> 17:31.620
Embroidered Uniform Guards will all benefit

17:31.620 --> 17:32.720
by controlling the financial power.

17:32.740 --> 17:33.750
Who doesn't want to

17:33.770 --> 17:35.960
live a better life while alive?

17:35.980 --> 17:37.990
Shen Zhong gets in their way,

17:38.010 --> 17:40.510
so no one wants to help him for sure.

17:40.530 --> 17:41.870
But there must be people who don't seek profits.

17:41.890 --> 17:43.630
Even if they don't seek profits, they will seek power.

17:43.650 --> 17:44.530
Shen Zhong controls

17:44.530 --> 17:46.200
Embroidered Uniform Guards all by himself.

17:46.220 --> 17:47.320
If he doesn't step down,

17:47.340 --> 17:48.890
how can others move up?

17:49.170 --> 17:50.360
If so,

17:50.380 --> 17:51.170
why didn't they challenge Shen Zhong

17:51.170 --> 17:53.080
as the Commander-in-chief

17:53.100 --> 17:54.030
in earlier years?

17:54.050 --> 17:56.480
In earlier years, he was deeply trusted by the Empress Dowager.

17:57.130 --> 17:58.700
They knew they couldn't beat him,

17:58.700 --> 17:59.980
so they bowed at his feet.

17:59.980 --> 18:01.370
What about now?

18:01.460 --> 18:03.250
Now with Shangshan Hu rising sharply,

18:03.250 --> 18:04.650
Shen Zhong is no longer the most powerful minister

18:04.650 --> 18:05.560
serving the Empress Dowager.

18:05.580 --> 18:06.960
Exactly.

18:07.410 --> 18:08.960
Have you planned all of that?

18:09.170 --> 18:10.110
Cutting off others' source of income

18:10.130 --> 18:11.770
is similar to killing their parents.

18:12.410 --> 18:13.620
The Embroidered Uniform Guards aren't

18:13.620 --> 18:15.480
the only ones to gain profits from the smuggling.

18:15.500 --> 18:16.720
Believe me.

18:16.820 --> 18:18.600
If Shen Zhong goes his own way,

18:19.290 --> 18:21.800
he'll become the target of public criticism in the end.

18:23.220 --> 18:25.080
But as long as the Empress Dowager trusts him,

18:25.100 --> 18:26.840
he'll be fine.

18:37.700 --> 18:40.800
Keep the birthday celebration simple.

18:40.820 --> 18:43.010
Just share the happiness with the people.

18:43.980 --> 18:45.390
I see.

18:45.410 --> 18:47.480
I'll handle it.

18:48.130 --> 18:50.080
You're occupied.

18:50.100 --> 18:51.840
No need to worry about

18:51.860 --> 18:53.930
such a miscellaneous thing.

18:54.340 --> 18:56.680
No, that one.

18:56.740 --> 18:57.650
But your birthday celebrations have been prepared

18:57.650 --> 18:59.840
by Embroidered Uniform Guards all the time.

19:00.340 --> 19:03.170
Yes, indeed.

19:03.860 --> 19:05.270
I remember that

19:05.290 --> 19:08.110
your subordinator, the deputy commander,

19:08.130 --> 19:10.600
is quite alert and resourceful.

19:10.930 --> 19:13.750
You can leave this to him.

19:13.770 --> 19:14.480
Your Majesty.

19:14.500 --> 19:17.360
I'm afraid that you might be too tired.

19:17.380 --> 19:19.250
I have to find someone capable

19:19.250 --> 19:21.800
to assist you.

19:23.170 --> 19:26.080
It's my turn. I haven't put down my chess piece.

19:27.820 --> 19:28.960
No.

19:28.980 --> 19:30.390
That one.

19:30.410 --> 19:32.990
Thank you, Your Majesty.

19:33.010 --> 19:35.410
You may leave.

19:39.410 --> 19:41.010
I win!

19:44.010 --> 19:46.890
Good! Let's play another round.

19:53.740 --> 19:56.230
Right, it's different now.

19:56.250 --> 19:57.050
Now the Grand General

19:57.050 --> 19:59.170
is most favored by Her Majesty.

20:02.130 --> 20:03.170
Contradicting Her Majesty in face,

20:03.170 --> 20:04.050
no wonder Her Majesty is displeased.

20:04.050 --> 20:04.930
I heard!

20:04.930 --> 20:06.620
He's not so trusted as before.

20:06.620 --> 20:08.530
Her Majesty seldom summons him.

20:25.440 --> 20:28.510
=Shen Mansion=

20:33.980 --> 20:35.200
Your Excellency,

20:35.220 --> 20:36.930
the tailor has finished

20:36.930 --> 20:38.150
altering your robe.

20:38.170 --> 20:40.030
The python pattern bestowed by

20:40.050 --> 20:41.680
Her Majesty has been embroidered on it.

21:06.580 --> 21:07.720
Your Excellency,

21:07.740 --> 21:09.800
isn't today the day when battalion commanders

21:09.820 --> 21:11.800
from different battalions come to report to you regularly?

21:11.820 --> 21:12.380
How come no one

21:12.380 --> 21:13.650
is here?

21:14.100 --> 21:16.960
Do I remember the wrong day?

21:17.700 --> 21:19.930
Two deputy commanders and two assistant commissioners

21:19.930 --> 21:21.440
have important things to attend to.

21:21.770 --> 21:23.030
Those battalion commanders

21:23.050 --> 21:25.530
are busy working.

21:25.930 --> 21:26.650
They should at least

21:26.650 --> 21:28.290
inform Your Excellency.

21:31.620 --> 21:33.720
It's not bad to be idle.

21:59.530 --> 22:00.600
In your opinion,

22:00.620 --> 22:01.930
why does the Empress Dowager

22:01.930 --> 22:03.410
suddenly treat Shen Zhong so coldly?

22:03.860 --> 22:06.110
Shen Zhong is too aggressive.

22:06.130 --> 22:08.080
The Empress Dowager didn't mind that before.

22:08.170 --> 22:09.030
It's because he could control

22:09.050 --> 22:10.840
the Embroidered Uniform Guards.

22:10.860 --> 22:11.990
She surely would tolerate

22:12.010 --> 22:13.770
a capable subordinate.

22:13.980 --> 22:15.510
But now is different.

22:15.530 --> 22:17.110
The Embroidered Uniform Guards are divided.

22:17.130 --> 22:19.130
Your Empress Dowager sees it all.

22:20.010 --> 22:22.030
Actually, she can eliminate

22:22.050 --> 22:23.390
the conspiracies

22:23.410 --> 22:24.960
and recover Shen Zhong's power easily.

22:24.980 --> 22:26.320
Why should she?

22:26.340 --> 22:27.680
Ministers getting separated

22:27.700 --> 22:28.870
in different cliques

22:28.890 --> 22:29.820
by competing for power

22:29.820 --> 22:31.200
is better for check and balance.

22:31.410 --> 22:32.720
It's much safer than

22:32.740 --> 22:34.010
having only one powerful minister.

22:34.410 --> 22:35.990
But Shen Zhong does everything

22:36.010 --> 22:37.390
out of his loyalty

22:37.410 --> 22:38.480
instead of selfness.

22:38.500 --> 22:40.440
What does loyalty have to do with that?

22:40.500 --> 22:41.560
In past dynasties,

22:41.580 --> 22:43.770
so many loyal ministers were killed.

22:47.130 --> 22:48.600
Where are we heading?

22:50.380 --> 22:52.170
I remember you drugged me

22:52.380 --> 22:54.130
when we first met.

22:54.380 --> 22:56.410
Why do you bring that up again?

22:57.380 --> 22:59.530
You lied to me that it was an aphrodisiac.

22:59.580 --> 23:01.630
I had no other choice.

23:01.650 --> 23:03.010
I thought it's over.

23:03.010 --> 23:04.480
I remember.

23:04.860 --> 23:05.890
Now I'm taking you to

23:05.890 --> 23:07.390
an extremely dangerous place

23:07.410 --> 23:09.230
to avenge the drug.

23:09.250 --> 23:10.440
If you're scared,

23:10.460 --> 23:11.800
just don't follow me.

23:13.700 --> 23:15.320
To avenge the drug.

23:16.100 --> 23:18.370
You even make a word.

23:25.700 --> 23:27.290
Whose home is this?

23:27.860 --> 23:29.200
Mine.

23:36.290 --> 23:38.050
Did you grow up here?

23:38.580 --> 23:40.130
Not really.

23:40.620 --> 23:42.770
My master asked me to stay in Shangjing.

23:43.290 --> 23:44.870
I love to stay quiet,

23:44.890 --> 23:46.720
so I took this place to grow vegetables.

23:46.740 --> 23:48.200
I visit here whenever I'm free.

23:50.050 --> 23:51.650
Are these all grown by you?

23:52.500 --> 23:53.360
As to the flowers,

23:53.380 --> 23:54.560
I just scattered the seeds randomly.

23:54.580 --> 23:55.510
I seldom took care of them.

23:55.530 --> 23:56.770
They grow on their own.

23:59.620 --> 24:00.990
She scattered the wild flower seeds

24:01.010 --> 24:03.440
she picked along the road

24:03.700 --> 24:05.740
by the wall randomly.

24:05.740 --> 24:06.530
She said,

24:06.530 --> 24:08.250
"No need to take care of them.

24:09.220 --> 24:10.890
Life can find its way

24:11.530 --> 24:14.250
to thrive."

24:16.740 --> 24:18.410
Who's that "she" you just mentioned?

24:19.250 --> 24:20.720
Your mom said

24:21.650 --> 24:23.510
it has its own destiny.

24:23.530 --> 24:24.840
Let it grow as it likes.

24:27.170 --> 24:27.650
You sound like

24:27.650 --> 24:29.890
a woman I know.

24:31.380 --> 24:33.080
Is she also a Saintess?

24:35.700 --> 24:36.990
It's a pity that

24:37.010 --> 24:38.870
the vegetables are not fully grown,

24:38.890 --> 24:40.720
or I wouldn't have to buy vegetables outside.

24:44.100 --> 24:45.370
I'll take it.

24:47.290 --> 24:49.050
So you like farming?

24:51.010 --> 24:54.290
It calms my mind.

24:56.170 --> 24:56.980
Others calm their minds

24:56.980 --> 24:58.840
by playing the zither and burning incense.

24:58.980 --> 25:00.530
I like it this way.

25:06.890 --> 25:08.170
Why not sit down?

25:09.820 --> 25:12.770
The soil should be turned.

25:14.820 --> 25:16.370
Soil?

25:55.820 --> 25:57.010
Thank you.

25:59.460 --> 26:01.170
The water is fresh and sweet.

26:01.770 --> 26:03.440
Why do you know how to farm?

26:03.460 --> 26:05.600
When learning poisons, I've planted poisonous weeds.

26:05.620 --> 26:07.080
It's the same.

26:09.100 --> 26:12.250
You're really weird.

26:13.380 --> 26:15.110
So are you.

26:15.130 --> 26:17.680
I can't see through you till now.

26:18.050 --> 26:19.440
Why do you want to see through me?

26:19.460 --> 26:21.250
What's the fun of that?

26:22.220 --> 26:23.680
It's no fun.

26:24.290 --> 26:25.630
If so,

26:25.650 --> 26:27.130
why do you do that?

26:27.580 --> 26:28.410
If we do nothing,

26:28.410 --> 26:30.080
how can we prove we're alive?

26:30.580 --> 26:32.480
Do we need to prove that?

26:33.860 --> 26:35.480
The common answer is

26:35.500 --> 26:36.800
"Don't we"?

26:37.460 --> 26:39.130
Which answer is uncommon?

26:39.220 --> 26:40.800
I've no idea.

26:41.890 --> 26:44.200
It seems we've been talking nonsense.

26:44.890 --> 26:46.510
I like it this way.

26:46.530 --> 26:48.130
Lazy and loosened,

26:48.770 --> 26:51.080
sit under the sun and talk nonsense.

26:51.410 --> 26:53.200
I don't find it hard.

26:54.500 --> 26:56.370
Do you often find it hard?

26:59.220 --> 27:01.890
Intriguing against each other with crafty tactics,

27:02.220 --> 27:04.200
it's like walking across an abyss

27:04.220 --> 27:05.800
on a vine.

27:07.130 --> 27:09.270
I just feel strained all the time.

27:09.290 --> 27:11.480
So I need time like this

27:11.500 --> 27:12.500
to sit idly with friends

27:12.500 --> 27:13.870
without thinking anything

27:13.890 --> 27:15.480
and talk casually.

27:16.100 --> 27:17.720
Is that so hard?

27:18.650 --> 27:19.860
It's hard to have free time,

27:19.860 --> 27:21.800
and it's even harder to find a friend.

27:22.740 --> 27:24.250
Are we friends?

27:26.410 --> 27:28.080
To some extent,

27:28.100 --> 27:29.600
we are enemies.

27:29.860 --> 27:31.200
But you know,

27:31.220 --> 27:32.600
the most dangerous people in the world

27:32.620 --> 27:34.170
are not your enemies.

27:36.500 --> 27:37.960
You are right.

27:38.340 --> 27:39.250
Now those who rally together

27:39.250 --> 27:41.150
to attack Shen Zhong

27:41.170 --> 27:42.960
are all his subordinates

27:43.010 --> 27:44.560
and friends.

27:44.580 --> 27:46.320
They're not his friends.

27:47.770 --> 27:48.960
I just said

27:48.980 --> 27:51.840
it's hard for people like us to have friends.

27:53.410 --> 27:55.360
If I didn't hear it wrong,

27:55.380 --> 27:57.600
Your Excellency, you're depressed.

27:58.530 --> 28:00.050
I'm just dissatisfied.

28:01.170 --> 28:03.960
Born into an influential family,
having a successful official career,

28:03.980 --> 28:05.750
and known as the poetic genius sent from Heaven,

28:05.770 --> 28:07.600
how can you be dissatisfied with

28:07.650 --> 28:09.410
such a life?

28:10.170 --> 28:12.890
I feel lonely.

28:14.410 --> 28:15.630
It sounds affected.

28:15.650 --> 28:17.530
I'm affected all the time.

28:18.770 --> 28:21.750
Now in the Investigator's Office, you're only second to the Head.

28:21.770 --> 28:24.080
You'll marry a beautiful wife when you're back.

28:24.100 --> 28:26.680
Your younger sister is known for her talent.

28:26.770 --> 28:28.390
Your father is a high-rank official.

28:28.410 --> 28:31.100
You associate with talented people of the time.

28:31.100 --> 28:33.250
How can you be lonely?

28:34.530 --> 28:38.080
Father is father, wife is wife, and sister is sister.

28:38.100 --> 28:39.680
They're my family,

28:39.700 --> 28:41.440
not my friends.

28:42.220 --> 28:43.560
As to others,

28:43.580 --> 28:45.530
we're tied up by interests.

28:47.340 --> 28:49.200
Call me a hypocrite

28:49.220 --> 28:51.530
or call me a fool.

28:52.340 --> 28:53.840
Anyway,

28:54.700 --> 28:57.050
I find it hard to be a minister,

28:57.860 --> 28:59.600
and unhappy

28:59.980 --> 29:02.050
to be a son.

29:02.100 --> 29:04.170
Do you really have no friend?

29:13.010 --> 29:15.370
Teng Zijing was my friend,

29:15.580 --> 29:17.130
but he died for me.

29:21.220 --> 29:22.890
Now,

29:23.340 --> 29:25.080
Wang Qinian can be counted as my friend.

29:25.340 --> 29:26.990
You really speak highly

29:27.010 --> 29:28.600
of him.

29:28.620 --> 29:31.080
Wang Qinian lives a more authentic life than I am.

29:31.820 --> 29:33.320
What do you mean by authentic?

29:33.530 --> 29:36.370
He fears his wife and loves his daughter.

29:36.530 --> 29:37.510
He lives his life

29:37.530 --> 29:39.440
for them.

29:39.930 --> 29:40.620
Though it's not easy

29:40.620 --> 29:41.870
for him sometimes,

29:41.890 --> 29:43.680
at least he's happy.

29:43.980 --> 29:45.530
Isn't your life authentic?

29:45.700 --> 29:47.840
I have so many secrets in my heart.

29:48.100 --> 29:51.530
I can't tell them and I have no one to tell them to.

29:52.650 --> 29:54.010
Like what?

29:57.580 --> 29:58.460
For example, I'm actually

29:58.460 --> 29:59.580
the son of Emperor Qing.

29:59.580 --> 30:00.530
I was born noble

30:00.530 --> 30:02.560
but brought up in the Fan family secretly.

30:03.740 --> 30:05.390
Don't tell me if you don't want to.

30:05.410 --> 30:07.290
No need to talk rubbish.

30:16.930 --> 30:18.080
Do you have anything else to say?

30:18.100 --> 30:19.370
Yes.

30:20.740 --> 30:22.050
I'm hungry.

30:30.380 --> 30:32.650
Stop staring at me. I won't eat in advance.

30:32.930 --> 30:34.800
I didn't expect you can cook.

30:35.700 --> 30:37.460
My senior fellow apprentices and I

30:37.460 --> 30:38.410
lived in the valley with my master.

30:38.410 --> 30:39.890
I was in charge for cooking.

30:40.740 --> 30:42.110
Aren't you his last apprentice?

30:42.130 --> 30:44.080
The last apprentice to cook.

30:44.700 --> 30:46.010
Well said.

30:47.250 --> 30:49.320
Wait over there. It won't take long.

30:57.010 --> 30:58.250
Have a try.

31:04.340 --> 31:05.650
It's really good.

31:06.010 --> 31:07.770
Aren't you afraid I might poison the dishes?

31:08.100 --> 31:09.480
Just go head.

31:09.700 --> 31:12.480
Right, you're a master of poison.

31:14.170 --> 31:15.440
What now?

31:15.460 --> 31:16.930
Do you have any wine?

31:17.700 --> 31:19.410
You're really making yourself at home.

31:19.410 --> 31:20.960
Better be good.

31:41.340 --> 31:42.800
It's really good.

31:42.820 --> 31:45.080
It's from Qingyu Hall in Nanqing.

31:45.860 --> 31:47.170
Really?

31:47.410 --> 31:48.600
Back then, Ye Qingmei

31:48.620 --> 31:50.030
was absolutely brilliant.

31:50.050 --> 31:52.080
Qingyu Hall gathered the wealth of the world.

31:52.100 --> 31:53.360
Anything good

31:53.380 --> 31:55.250
must be from her firm.

31:56.010 --> 31:57.800
She was really amazing.

32:10.010 --> 32:11.270
Do you think

32:11.290 --> 32:12.870
I pretend to

32:12.890 --> 32:14.650
drown my sorrow

32:14.770 --> 32:16.930
despite an infinite bright future?

32:18.130 --> 32:20.290
I have no time to think about that.

32:20.500 --> 32:21.510
I can't let you

32:21.530 --> 32:22.340
drink up the good wine

32:22.340 --> 32:23.930
all alone.

32:48.380 --> 32:50.250
It's tuneless.

32:51.650 --> 32:53.840
I suddenly remember a piece of poetry

32:53.860 --> 32:55.800
which suits me well.

32:56.010 --> 32:57.440
Tell me about it.

32:59.820 --> 33:03.440
Leave behind a residue of happiness!
Leave behind a residue of happiness!

33:04.050 --> 33:06.010
Unexpectedly you will come across a benefactor!

33:06.100 --> 33:09.800
Fortunate enough your mother, your own mother,

33:09.890 --> 33:11.800
will have laid by a store of virtue
and secret meritorious actions!

33:12.410 --> 33:14.150
My advice to you, mankind,

33:14.170 --> 33:16.010
is to relieve the destitute and succour the distressed!

33:16.460 --> 33:17.890
Do not resemble those

33:17.890 --> 33:20.410
who will harp after lucre and show themselves
unmindful of the ties of relationship:

33:20.410 --> 33:22.410
that wolflike maternal uncle of yours
and that impostor of a brother!

33:23.930 --> 33:26.270
For far above the constellations,

33:26.290 --> 33:28.770
one watches all and makes just calculations.

33:35.100 --> 33:36.560
It sounds familiar.

33:38.580 --> 33:40.650
It's the sum-up for Sister Qiao

33:42.980 --> 33:44.930
in the Red Mansions.

33:45.460 --> 33:46.800
What's it called?

33:46.820 --> 33:48.410
Leave behind a residue of happiness!

33:50.700 --> 33:52.720
Relieve the destitute and succour the distressed.

33:52.860 --> 33:54.720
It actually reflects a kind heart.

33:55.290 --> 33:56.770
It's so hard.

33:58.340 --> 33:59.390
My master said

33:59.410 --> 34:00.360
the more difficult a thing is,

34:00.380 --> 34:02.170
the harder one should work to make it happen.

34:05.770 --> 34:07.890
You're trying to strengthen me out.

34:09.970 --> 34:12.600
Why are men different from animals?

34:12.620 --> 34:14.130
It's only because men value righteousness.

34:14.340 --> 34:15.230
Your Majesty,

34:15.250 --> 34:17.230
though we're from different countries,

34:17.250 --> 34:18.640
but all the people in the world

34:18.660 --> 34:20.370
are the same.

34:21.100 --> 34:22.880
I hope that you spare no efforts

34:22.900 --> 34:25.370
in preventing the war after going back,

34:25.620 --> 34:27.560
thus saving all the people from hell.

34:28.340 --> 34:31.190
You wanted to kill Xiao En before.

34:31.210 --> 34:34.840
Wasn't him a living man?

34:35.770 --> 34:37.600
Saving thousands of men by killing one man,

34:37.620 --> 34:39.280
what's wrong with that?

34:39.820 --> 34:42.430
It's not a simple calculation.

34:42.450 --> 34:43.970
If one hundred men

34:44.690 --> 34:46.490
will die one day.

34:46.530 --> 34:49.890
By killing 49 of them, you can save 51.

34:50.100 --> 34:52.040
Will you kill them or not?

35:03.290 --> 35:04.890
In this sense,

35:05.730 --> 35:09.890
we're both heartless.

35:12.340 --> 35:14.000
Let me be.

35:15.210 --> 35:17.080
Let me

35:18.140 --> 35:20.000
get drunk today.

35:26.730 --> 35:28.450
Drink less.

35:29.210 --> 35:31.210
Don't get drunk.

35:59.770 --> 36:01.240
You are?

36:04.730 --> 36:06.210
You're awake.

36:07.050 --> 36:08.450
Miss Lili!

36:09.940 --> 36:11.410
I thought

36:11.860 --> 36:14.080
you'll sleep the whole night?

36:14.290 --> 36:15.970
It's almost dawn.

36:20.580 --> 36:22.080
I have no status,

36:22.420 --> 36:24.450
so I still live outside the imperial palace.

36:25.770 --> 36:27.130
But it won't take long.

36:27.290 --> 36:29.210
After the Empress Dowager's birthday,

36:29.490 --> 36:31.210
I can move into the imperial palace.

36:32.620 --> 36:34.130
I...

36:39.730 --> 36:41.560
I don't know

36:43.490 --> 36:46.890
why I keep thinking of you

36:48.180 --> 36:50.040
like I've lost my mind.

36:57.580 --> 36:59.600
I just want to see you

36:59.620 --> 37:01.190
before moving into the imperial palace

37:01.210 --> 37:03.450
and tell you about my feelings.

37:06.820 --> 37:08.450
Fan Xian,

37:11.290 --> 37:12.890
I like you.

37:18.420 --> 37:19.730
Miss Lili,

37:20.420 --> 37:22.490
I have a fianc矇e named Lin Wan'er.

37:22.970 --> 37:23.880
I've sworn

37:23.900 --> 37:25.600
to only love her in my life.

37:26.490 --> 37:27.470
A lifetime

37:27.490 --> 37:29.890
is long, but it's also short.

37:30.100 --> 37:31.650
I'm narrow-minded.

37:32.380 --> 37:33.840
I can't have someone else

37:34.580 --> 37:36.600
in my heart this life.

37:41.940 --> 37:43.930
You don't have to say that.

37:45.530 --> 37:47.760
I just want to tell you.

37:49.210 --> 37:51.130
You love the one in your heart,

37:52.380 --> 37:54.840
and I love the one in my heart.

37:57.210 --> 37:59.000
Let's not bother each other,

38:00.490 --> 38:01.650
OK?

38:05.180 --> 38:08.930
After tonight, we may not see each other.

38:10.940 --> 38:12.840
In the future,

38:14.660 --> 38:18.450
we probably won't meet again.

38:21.420 --> 38:23.690
I just want to talk to you.

38:25.940 --> 38:26.860
I asked Duoduo

38:26.860 --> 38:29.080
to help me.

38:31.580 --> 38:33.360
It might be absurd,

38:33.380 --> 38:35.410
but I don't regret it.

38:37.690 --> 38:39.130
Don't be nervous.

38:43.380 --> 38:45.130
I just want to talk.

38:54.900 --> 38:56.370
Or we may

38:57.620 --> 38:59.170
talk about the girl

38:59.940 --> 39:01.800
in your heart.

39:02.580 --> 39:04.370
How did you meet?

39:05.690 --> 39:08.240
How did she walk into your heart?

39:12.620 --> 39:15.690
Tell me your story

39:16.180 --> 39:17.470
so my curiosity can be satisfied.

39:17.490 --> 39:19.130
You really want to hear?

39:19.770 --> 39:21.280
Yes.

39:34.660 --> 39:36.360
Actually we met

39:36.380 --> 39:38.130
by accident.

39:38.380 --> 39:41.230
I just arrived in the capital city from Danzhou.

39:41.250 --> 39:43.000
In the Qing Temple,

39:43.290 --> 39:45.100
when I first

39:45.100 --> 39:46.180
met her,

39:46.180 --> 39:48.130
she had a...

39:53.660 --> 39:55.320
The cocks are crowing.

39:57.250 --> 39:58.520
What?

40:02.100 --> 40:04.170
All the cocks are crowing.

40:05.420 --> 40:07.800
Do you know what that means?

40:09.340 --> 40:10.890
What does that mean?

40:11.690 --> 40:13.210
It's dawn.

40:20.420 --> 40:21.730
Finished talking?

40:22.730 --> 40:24.520
When did you drug me?

40:24.580 --> 40:25.800
You're the apprentice of Fei Jie.

40:25.820 --> 40:27.320
Why would I drug you?

40:27.340 --> 40:28.990
Then why did I pass out?

40:29.010 --> 40:30.400
The wine is strong.

40:30.420 --> 40:31.600
You were not drugged,

40:31.620 --> 40:32.600
but drunk.

40:32.620 --> 40:33.800
Then why were you OK?

40:33.820 --> 40:34.990
I'm gifted.

40:35.010 --> 40:36.320
I've never got drunk since I was a child.

40:36.340 --> 40:37.650
You...

40:37.820 --> 40:39.120
I told you

40:39.140 --> 40:40.990
I would avenge the drug.

40:41.010 --> 40:42.520
You were careless yourself.

40:47.250 --> 40:48.730
What's wrong with you?!

40:56.840 --> 41:01.030
=Shangjing Town=

41:08.660 --> 41:10.410
Python pattern bestowed by Her Majesty.

41:11.210 --> 41:12.470
Your Excellency, in the imperial court now,

41:12.490 --> 41:14.970
only you have the honor.

41:15.010 --> 41:17.990
Your Excellency, today is Her Majesty's birthday.

41:18.010 --> 41:20.690
When you enter the Hall, you might as well...

41:20.730 --> 41:21.840
What?

41:21.860 --> 41:23.160
You might as well take a step back

41:23.180 --> 41:25.130
and agree on the smuggling.

41:25.970 --> 41:28.270
Your Excellency, not only the Embroidered Uniform Guards,

41:28.290 --> 41:30.690
but all the ministries are paying attention to this.

41:30.770 --> 41:32.140
If you still refuse to compromise,

41:32.140 --> 41:33.400
you'll really offend

41:33.420 --> 41:34.880
all the ministers in the imperial court.

41:34.900 --> 41:36.120
As long as you take a step back,

41:36.140 --> 41:37.140
Her Majesty will surely be happy.

41:37.140 --> 41:37.900
By then,

41:37.900 --> 41:39.800
you'll still be in charge of the Embroidered Uniform Guards

41:45.250 --> 41:47.080
If I worry about my life,

41:47.820 --> 41:50.490
I don't deserve the robe.

41:52.250 --> 41:53.520
Your Excellency!

42:19.140 --> 42:20.490
Please.

42:25.530 --> 42:26.930
Your Excellencies,

42:27.580 --> 42:29.040
that way, please.

42:35.380 --> 42:36.560
Your Excellency! Your Excellency!

42:36.580 --> 42:38.000
It's over there!

42:41.860 --> 42:43.690
Can we sit here?

42:44.050 --> 42:45.520
Yes, your seats are here.

42:48.580 --> 42:49.800
If he doesn't let us sit here,

42:49.820 --> 42:51.600
we'll have to sit outside the Hall.

43:02.940 --> 43:04.140
Langtao wants to challenge Fan Xian

43:04.140 --> 43:05.800
on the Hall.

43:16.730 --> 43:17.930
Your Excellency.

43:41.530 --> 43:42.730
Your Excellency!

43:43.530 --> 43:44.600
Are you OK?

43:44.620 --> 43:45.700
I'm fine.

43:46.140 --> 43:48.930
Take him to a cool place, and let him drink more water.

44:25.280 --> 44:28.860
In the river of history,

44:28.880 --> 44:32.350
time goes round and round.

44:35.160 --> 44:38.500
Memories about the former and present lives

44:38.520 --> 44:42.590
join each other in an endless way.

44:44.480 --> 44:47.100
In the long drunken Milky Way,

44:47.120 --> 44:49.360
one season follows another in a flash,

44:49.360 --> 44:51.860
and the wild geese are flying south.

44:51.880 --> 44:53.480
I just can't give up

44:53.480 --> 44:56.820
to be with you for my whole life.

44:56.840 --> 45:02.310
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

45:03.560 --> 45:06.110
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

45:06.400 --> 45:08.440
Year after year in the wandering,

45:08.440 --> 45:11.100
I count the remaining years.

45:11.120 --> 45:13.300
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

45:13.320 --> 45:15.310
even though we have ended up the destiny,

45:15.600 --> 45:17.990
I never feel regretful.

45:18.040 --> 45:19.400
In such a chaotic world,

45:19.400 --> 45:22.380
I still miss you as ever.

45:22.400 --> 45:25.350
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

45:25.640 --> 45:27.700
With a gentle heart,

45:27.720 --> 45:30.380
I cherish our remaining years.

45:30.400 --> 45:31.920
Even though we have to go through

45:31.920 --> 45:34.430
all the hardships along the journey,

45:34.560 --> 45:41.750
you always stay by my side,

45:41.840 --> 45:44.510
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

45:44.800 --> 45:46.880
Year after year in the wandering,

45:46.880 --> 45:49.540
I count the remaining years.

45:49.560 --> 45:51.700
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

45:51.720 --> 45:53.950
even though we end up the destiny,

45:54.160 --> 45:56.340
I never feel regretful.

45:56.360 --> 45:57.760
In such a chaotic world,

45:57.760 --> 46:00.820
I still miss you as ever.

46:00.840 --> 46:03.950
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

46:04.040 --> 46:06.180
With a gentle heart,

46:06.200 --> 46:08.900
I cherish our remaining years.

46:08.920 --> 46:10.360
Even though we have to go through

46:10.360 --> 46:13.020
all the hardships along the journey,

46:13.040 --> 46:21.800
you always stay by my side...
